        <detaileddescription>
<para>Data completeness:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>0:</bold> Complete</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>1:</bold> Incomplete, more data to come in new events</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>2:</bold> Incomplete, data truncated, no more to come</para>
